Subject: [Buildroot] [PATCH 2/3] package/libgcrypt: add upstream patch to
 add pkg-config file
In-Reply-To: <20190704104321.2598-1-joerg.krause@embedded.rocks>
References: <20190704104321.2598-1-joerg.krause@embedded.rocks>
